# --others takes no codes of its own
behavior: ruff-rejects-bad-code-arguments
args: ruff check --others B904
exit: 2
-- @stderr --
necro: ruff: --others takes no codes: necro ruff [--files-from <file>] [--write [--only-at <file>]] (check (<code>… | --others [--except=<code>,…]) | format) [-- <pathspec>…]
